   "heading": {
    "en": "Citation and commencement"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "1. This Order may be cited as the Co‑operative Societies (Modification under Section 97) (No. 2) Order 2015 and comes into operation on 14 April 2015."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "SG-H684-A2",
   "no": 2,
   "noLabel": {
    "en": "2."
   },
   "heading": {
    "en": "Modification of section 39(1)(a) of Act"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "2. Section 39(1)(a) of the Act is, in its application to the Industrial and Services Co‑operative Society Limited, modified to the extent that a person may be admitted to membership in the society whether or not that person is —\n(a)a bankrupt; or\n(b)a person against whom a conviction stands for an offence punishable with imprisonment."
   }
  }
